9. Termination
--------------

The permissions in section 2 end automatically if you breach section 3. They
are reinstated if you cure the breach and the copyright holder does not object.

Termination under this section concerns the permissions granted by this license
only. It does not affect a subsisting contract for the free account or for
Kiebitz Plus, which ends only as provided in the Terms of Service referenced in
section 4 and under applicable law, nor does it affect any statutory right you
have as a consumer.

